The champion simulates the round twice: it first applies damage/advance manually (building `pir`) and then calls `simulate_round(new_cann, pirates)`, which repeats the same round on the original pirate list. This double‑simulation inflates the estimated deficit and can discard otherwise good actions; we fix it by using the already‑updated `pir` and `new_cann` as the post‑round state instead of running `simulate_round` again.

